{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAp8ys7UkDM9VgTQiqUu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Replays are missing for new-UI users because the new app shell doesn't wrap its app widget in `PostHogWidget`. On mobile, PostHog builds a replay from screenshots of the screen, and `PostHogWidget` is what takes them. The old shell (`lib/legacy_app.dart`) has the wrapper; the redesigned shell (`lib/new_app.dart`, the default via `NEW_UI=true`) returns a bare `MaterialApp.router`. So new-UI users still send events, taps and screen views, but no frames are ever captured. PostHog shows no error for this.\n\nThat matches the ticket: same build and same SDK version, events fine, and replays only from the A/B group still on the old UI. The project settings weren't the problem, and neither was `lib/analytics.dart`, which already turns replay on before setup.\n\n**Fix:**\n- `lib/new_app.dart`: wrapped `MaterialApp.router` in `PostHogWidget(...)`, with a comment explaining that replay needs it.\n- `lib/legacy_app.dart`: added a comment to the existing wrapper so nobody removes it.\n\n**Checks:** `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I haven't run the app on a device or emulator, so the fix isn't confirmed end to end yet. To check it, run `flutter run --dart-define=NEW_UI=true`, go through calculator → apply → offers, and put the app in the background so it sends its data. Within a few minutes the session should appear in PostHog's Session replay tab, showing your screens and not just a list of events. Users only get the fix with the next store release.\n\nRunning `flutter pub get` changed `analysis_options.yaml` and created `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`. I undid those, so only the two Dart files and `ANSWER.md` are changed. Nothing is committed. `ANSWER.md` has the full notes, including a reminder that any future app shell (a flavor, a white-label build) needs its own `PostHogWidget`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":329,"cache_read_input_tokens":26298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":329},"output_tokens":661,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6797f115-0922-4f0b-b630-ca7b897f7c1a","uuid":"29d86c7d-19ba-4e06-9279-3c36312295c4","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:33:29.585Z","request_id":"req_011CgAp8ybF9TTb6dZmn94d6"}
